      "reason": "Guideline S004 provides specific dosing (penicillin 25 mg/kg q12h, gentamicin 5 mg/kg) which the plan omits, leaving dosing unspecified."
    }
  ],
  "critical_omissions": [
    "No dosage/frequency for benzylpenicillin (S004)",
    "No gentamicin dosing or justification for omission (S004)",
    "Blood culture before first antibiotic dose not mentioned (S006)",
    "Duration of therapy not specified (S005, S009)",
    "Criteria for stopping antibiotics at 36 h not addressed (S009)"
  ],
  "regimen_incomplete": true,
  "rationale": "Plan aligns with risk assessment but omits required dosing details and excludes gentamicin contrary to NICE NG195 first‑line recommendation (S004). It also fails to note pre‑antibiotic blood culture, treatment duration, and stopping criteria, reducing completeness and safety."
